<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001C_S000C" variety="S000C">
<name>Audio &amp; Visual</name>
<ttl id="1001C_S000C_742AD_T002O" variety="T002O">
<name>Speaker Assembly Front NO.1</name>
<para id="RM000002BZN001X" category="A" type-id="80001" name-id="641JQ-00" from="200612">
<name>Removal</name>
<subpara id="RM000002BZN001X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000002BZN001X_01_0017" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QO00000">
<ptxt>Remove Front Door Inside Handle Bezel RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a screwdriver with its tip wrapped in protective tape, disengage the 3 claws and remove the front door inside handle bezel RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153613J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZN001X_01_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QP00000">
<ptxt>Remove Door Assist Grip Cover RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a screwdriver with its tip wrapped in protective tape, disengage the 4 claws and remove the door assist grip cover RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153615J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZN001X_01_0019" proc-id="RM0550J___00009QQ00000">
<ptxt>Remove Front Door Trim Board Sub-assembly RH
</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 3 screws.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B157312" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a clip remover, disengage the 9 clips of the front door trim board RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153617" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disengage the 4 claws and disconnect the front door trim board RH from the front door glass weatherstrip inner RH.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disengage the 2 claws and remove the front door trim board RH from the front door inside handle RH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B153618" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connectors.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1></s-1>
<s-1 id="RM000002BZN001X_01_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00007DT00000">
<ptxt>Remove Speaker Assembly Front NO.1</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E137089J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector.</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Remove the 3 rivets and remove front speaker assembly NO.1 from the front door.</ptxt>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>